<code>assert 0 <= index && index <= \old(this.size()) && role != null => \forall int i; index < i && i < \old(this.size()); this.get(i) == \old(this.get(i-1));</code>

This ensures that for every position from `index + 1` to the old size of the list, the element at the current position is equal to the old element at the previous position.

